Not all schools held a traditional ceremony on September 1.
There is peace not in all of Ukraine.
We have to fight for peace.
The whole of Ukraine, the united Ukrainian front, must fight for peace.
Alexan Pastukhov, a teacher at school in Slavyansk, attended by Yatsenyuk's daughter, spoke in Russian.
We hope that peace will finally be achieved here and that children will gain knowledge that will be useful to them in the future.
The first day of school is traditionally celebrated in such a way that children put on embroidered shirts, bring balloons and give flowers to teachers.
In Rona Fairhead, the BBC may have found a boss for tough times
