That's why so much of its content is historically and scientifically completely wrong, whether it's almost anything from the beginning to the end.
We are talking about people who believed that snakes and donkeys could talk, believing in incantations, blood sacrifices, ritual spells, enchanted objects, fiery potions, astrology, and five elements of magic.
