If it came from the pen of a truly superior being and was intended as a literal history, then it would not contain any of what it contains at all.
As a moral guide, it totally fails because, most of the original Hebrew writings have been written by uneducated and bigoted savages who have overlooked or promoted cruelty towards animals, incest, slavery, slave abuse, abuse of family members, child abuse, violence against children, abortion, looting, murder, cannibalism, genocide and prejudice towards race, gender, gender
To defend their inhumanity by claiming that they are doing God’s will.
However, creationists continue to ignore all of this.
