It's ironic that they're rejecting God's "work" as "the worship of creation instead of a creator."
But they themselves regard the word of man as the word of God and of God himself, and even insist that refuting their supposedly "holy" books somehow refutes the god itself.
Not their version of god, but all versions of God.
