Because they have to, educational military obligatory.
Well, inside, the cold humidity of the floor and the light smell of disinfection, a poisoned janitor with a mop, unfortunately still the same one, who is said to lend the pupil a key to the tin cabinet, where you can leave textbooks and which are still so few.
For the bottle.
